    "summary": "dsh-univer-office@0.3.5 is a DSH Web bundle (dsh.client.platform=web) that adds Univer office editing tools, a bundled collaboration Gateway, and a Viewer mounted on the DSH WebServer origin. Author intent is a Web profile: README installs with `dsh plugin --profile web add dsh-univer-office` and restarts with `dsh web`. Node intent is major 22: engines.node \">=22.19.0\" in both source and published manifests, a README badge for >=22.19, and CI/release workflows configured with node 22. No author-recommended major other than 22 appears, so 22 is selected as both declared-support and CI-tested. Development uses pnpm@11.23.0. README claims support for DSH 0.1.5-rc.3, 0.1.7-alpha.2, and 0.1.7-rc.1, which do not include the target 0.2.0-rc.1; these are author claims, not compatibility results. No SDK, ACP, or headless author workflow is documented, and no disabling/offline startup flags are evidenced.",
